Bundled wallpapers
------------------

The six wallpapers shipped in resources/wallpapers/ (Midnight Mesh, Ember,
Tidal, Graphite, Drift, Plasma Drift) are part of this project and are
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Third-party dependencies
------------------------

This project depends on the following Rust crates, each under the MIT or
Apache-2.0 licence:

  clap          MIT OR Apache-2.0
  env_logger    MIT OR Apache-2.0
  log           MIT OR Apache-2.0
  serde         MIT OR Apache-2.0
  serde_json    MIT OR Apache-2.0
  thiserror     MIT OR Apache-2.0
  cc            MIT OR Apache-2.0   (build dependency)

On macOS the project links against system frameworks (AppKit, AVFoundation,
WebKit, Metal, CoreGraphics), which are provided by the operating system and
covered by Apple's own licence terms.